WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.300
Why do we add + c when integrating?

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.040
Many curves share the same slope.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:14.430
x², x² + 1, x² − 3

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:17.980
All have slope 2x.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:21.013
The c covers every one of them.
